 "missing_courtyard_verdict": "BOSS1 and BOSS2 are enclosure mounting bosses and carry no courtyard, so every courtyard-based check on this board -- the placement contract, apply_part_shift's own vetting -- has always been blind to them.  D-758 measures the boss keep-outs directly instead (d758-boss-clearance.json).  The footprints are library masters and a courtyard is not added here: doing so would raise lib_footprint_mismatch, a class this programme drove to zero (D-233).",
