 ],
 "track_not_centered_on_via_verdict": "five joins, four on USB_VBUS_CHG and one on Q3_CS.  Every one of them lands its track end INSIDE the via pad and over the barrel, so the connection is annular-ring copper and not a tangency; connection_width_contract's pairs_below_strict set does not contain any of them.  Recorded, not repaired -- repairing would move copper on a 1.1 A rail for an etch-cosmetic reason.",
 "what": "the DRC tests this board's setup sets to 'ignore', PROBED in a scratch copy at severity warning.  A switched-off test is an absent test, not a passing one (D-738, D-744); this is the same reading applied to severity rather than to a zeroed threshold."
}
